  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "沿世界树穿越三条时间线，以“牺牲/救赎”选择神器或众神援助并改变世界进程",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "World Creation Rooted in Norse mythology, players assume the role of an \"Inheritor,\" reborn through the cycles, and embark on a journey from Muspelheim to explore the vast realms supported by the World Tree. By traversing the timelines of Voidom, Primglory, and Trurem, players have the choice of \"Sacrifice\" or \"Redemption,\" allowing them to acquire artifacts or seek the assistance of hundreds of deities, including Odin the Allfather and Loki the Evil, to shape the progression of the world.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3074440/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "反击与技能链要求读取Boss行为序列，并抓住眩晕或失衡窗口集中爆发",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The integration of counterattacks with skill chains empowers players to analyze the behavioral patterns and attack sequences of diverse bosses. Seizing the opportune moments when they are stunned or staggered, players can unleash focused attacks, making great damage.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3074440/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "把怪物灵魂核心嵌入技能链，再与主角职业特性组合出战斗流派",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Embedding the soul cores of monsters into the skill chain allows the protagonist to harness the power of souls in combat. Paired with the protagonist's professional features to find out limitless possibilities for the style of combat.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3074440/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
